  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Add the water to a medium saucepan and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839588442dc4b9281988833/step-0cf7a700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, trim and halve pea pods lengthways.\n• Thinly slice carrot into sticks.\n• Thinly slice red apple into wedges. Little cooks: Help wash the veggies!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839588442dc4b9281988833/step-d6612a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour, sweet soy seasoning and a pinch of salt.\n• In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg.\n• In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip Japanese tofu steaks into flour mixture to coat, followed by the egg, and finally in breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839588442dc4b9281988833/step-2142b920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook crumbed tofu in batches until golden and cooked through, 2-4 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Ensure the oil is hot before cooking the crumbed tofu for best results!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839588442dc4b9281988833/step-b62fee30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, combine garlic aioli and Japanese style dressing. Little cooks: Take charge by combining the sauces!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839588442dc4b9281988833/step-38b20e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice, crumbed tofu steaks and mixed vibrant veggies between plates.\n• Serve with creamy Japanese dressing. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6839588442dc4b9281988833/step-3adfd050.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
